#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectdistortion.rst:23 92e94bb3cee24ade9706dd203712c6ad
msgid ""
"FmodAudioEffectDistortion applies various types of distortion to audio signals, creating effects "
"ranging from subtle overdrive to harsh digital artifacts. It supports multiple distortion modes "
"including hard clipping, soft clipping, tube overdrive, lo-fi reduction, and bitcrushing."
msgstr ""
"**FmodAudioEffectDistortion**    会在效果链中创建自定义失真 DSP。它通过    ``mode``    "
"切换不同失真算法，并提供前级增益、驱动量、后级增益、高频保留和过采样控制。"

#: ../../source/classes/class_fmodaudioeffectdistortion.rst:25 9ca553a10363407f999199e1f46640c4
msgid "Use this effect to add grit, warmth, or aggressive character to audio."
msgstr "用于增加粗粝感、温暖感或强烈的失真音色。"

